{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"バッグについてた\n大好きなキーホルダーを\nなくしてしまって\nがち凹みしてる中田です＞＜\nどこへいったの、マイハニー？\nああ、愛おしい(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて今日は\nみさみさの誕生日でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/cherry.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なのに逆に\nみさみさから嬉しすぎること\n言われちゃったよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/lovely.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさみさおめでとう＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はイベントだ!\n会えるのほんと楽しみ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/confident.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当たらなかったかたも\n多かったみたいですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/thunder.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも次のCDで個別あるみたいだし！\n当たった方も\n惜しくもはずれてしまったかたも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"兄さんにお世話になってくださいよ！←←←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラグビーわかる？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nルールとかは\nよく知らないんですけど\nパパがやってたみたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/penguin.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハンドボール知ってる？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n野球みたいなやつですよね？\nやったことないんですよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/wobbly.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度教えてください(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サッカーしてる人どう？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nかっこいいですよ！\nなにかに頑張ってる人がかっこいい\nとか鉄板じゃないですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/lovely.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何ラーメンが好き？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n塩ですかね～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/cat.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男だったらメンバーの誰と\n付き合いたい？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n推しと彼女だったら\nけっこう違いますよね！\nう～ん、迷うな～←\nなぁちゃんかな！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかくっついてくるのが\n可愛いんだよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近の飛鳥！\nたまにうちの脚で寝ます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/chick.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝顔独り占め"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/heart02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"は、ずるいかなって思って\nあなたにもおすそわけ(*^^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/05/111230_164901.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛すぎるぜ丶(；；)ノ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てわけで\n会える方はまたね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}